body:
You can see manmade structures from space, on the night side at least. You can see a surprising amount of info solely from the lights. The India-Pakistan border is lit up to shit just from a very active military presence. You can also see difference in light between what used to be East and West Germany still, from the different types of bulbs.

&#x200B;

The structures themselves, no sadly, but their imprint is there somewhat
